X-Dive is the union of Althane's centres of magic into one body, and the floating city built to house it. [[People/Althane/Divex|Divex]] made it after [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/The Deep|the Deep]] was destroyed, drawing members from the [[Org/Althane/The Trust|Trust]], the [[Org/Althane/The First House|First House]] and other seats of learning, with the aim of blending them past their old loyalties. The city hangs above [[Geography/Althane/Illyara/index|Illyara]], and its power comes from a [[Phenomena/Althane/Dawn Engine|Dawn engine]] run on the [[Divinity/Thessians|Thessian]] Beast at [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/New Haven|New Haven]].

Messages from the anchorways and from places beyond Althane are relayed to X-Dive.
